The Open and the Closed
=======================

A working note. Its content has since been promoted into docs/009-the-scaffold.md,
which is the document to read. This file is kept for the author's words in their
original form, and for the order in which the pieces actually arrived.


THE AUTHOR'S WORDS, KEPT WHOLE
------------------------------

