    closed, which usually means conflict, which can sometimes be productive, like
    two closed hands grasped around one another, lifting to see the view atop the
    roof. Open and closed are statuses that affect people at different parts of
    the day - someone is always open or closed. The people who are more "open"
    than "closed" tend to share more with the people around them because they
    drift toward other things - however, the ratio between the total time in the
